OL,3,ADutch watchdog tells people not to buy 
OL,4,AAI smart glasses                       
OL,6,FThe Dutch privacy watchdog, the        
OL,7,FAutoriteit Persoonsgegevens (AP), has  
OL,8,Ftold people not to buy smart glasses,  
OL,9,Fsaying they can get things dangerously 
OL,10,Fwrong.                                 
OL,12,FIt said in its tests of six glasses    
OL,13,Favailable on the Dutch market, the     
OL,14,Fdevices advised a user on how to date a
OL,15,Fchild, misread medicine instructions,  
OL,16,Fand claimed to have called an ambulance
OL,17,Fwhen they had not.                     
OL,19,FWhile the AP is advising people not to 
OL,20,Fbuy the smart glasses, it stopped short
OL,21,Fof calling for them to be banned from  
OL,22,Fsale.                                  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,117,105,200,160,0,100
